      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "The EST II Mathematics subject test is a rigorous examination for students in international and American-diploma programmes who wish to demonstrate advanced mathematical competency for university admissions. It covers algebra, geometry, trigonometry, and data analysis at a depth beyond the core EST I test.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "note",
        "label": {
          "en": "What to expect",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "EST II Math is taken as a standalone subject test on the EST II examination day. It contains both multiple-choice and short constructed-response questions. The content aligns closely with pre-calculus and advanced secondary mathematics.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
